Z||000002||87ECO5||03-30-2001||09:41 AM||||If I remember correctly, the idea went in different directions.  There were a few folks on the forum that offered to do the job.  There were also members that took the image to a custom vinyl shop (like I did).<P>I had Paul McKibben cut a few examples for BOILERMAKER and myself.  They turned out really nice.  He charged me $5/decal and that included shipping.  I have dealt with Paul on many occasions and was always COMPLETELY satisfied!<P>Paul still has the image - in case the shop down the street from you doesn't work out.||||reg||1
